rget=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:318add87-c9fe-420b-b1a3-901209d46809\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Found on the headless body of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lu_La_Forza\" title=\"Lu La Forza\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b1/Portrait_Lu_La_Forza.png/25px-Portrait_Lu_La_Forza.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b1/Portrait_Lu_La_Forza.png/38px-Portrait_Lu_La_Forza.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b1/Portrait_Lu_La_Forza.png/50px-Portrait_Lu_La_Forza.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lu La Forza\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b1/Portrait_Lu_La_Forza.png/25px-Portrait_Lu_La_Forza.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b1/Portrait_Lu_La_Forza.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Lu_La_Forza\" title=\"Lu La Forza\">Lu La Forza</a> in the control centre of <a href=\"/wiki/Steel_Watch_Foundry\" title=\"Steel Watch Foundry\">Steel Watch Foundry</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-1982&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;201</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>Bendobrus -\n</p><p><br>\nIf this note ever finds its way to you, it means I'm dead, but at least I died trying. As the Chief Artificer on the <a href=\"/wiki/Steel_Watcher_Titan\" title=\"Steel Watcher Titan\">Titan</a> project, I know just what that horror can do, and I'm determined to see it destroyed. <a href=\"/wiki/Zanner_Toobin\" title=\"Zanner Toobin\">Zander Toobin</a> mentioned that if the proper code is entered into the Neurocitor, it triggers a fatal psionic feedback loop. I don't know what that code is, but I might be able to guess it. And if I die taking down the Titan, that will be a good death. I love you.\n</p><p><br>\n- Lu La\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714215715\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.055 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.058 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1925/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 32231/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 8625/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 2/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.012/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 936284/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   46.526      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   46.526      1 -total\n 55.67%   25.900      8 Template:Icon_text\n 49.07%   22.831     19 Template:Trim\n 20.58%    9.576      2 Template:Uid\n 17.76%    8.264      3 Template:Icon_link\n 17.19%    7.998      1 Template:Main_only\n 12.42%    5.779      1 Template:Notes\n 11.88%    5.525      2 Template:Template_style\n 11.37%    5.289      8 Template:Ifempty\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:30799-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714215715 and revision id 365679. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}